FFIILLEESS
     /dev/led/em*  identification LED device nodes

EEXXAAMMPPLLEESS
     Make the identification LED of em0 blink:

           echo f2 > /dev/led/em0

     Turn the identification LED of em0 off again:

           echo 0 > /dev/led/em0

